Blockchain Networks 

1. MainNet (Production)
    - Public bitcoin network
    - Production version of the Bitcoin Core network
    - Real bitcoins with real value
2. TestNet (Preproduction)
    - Public Bitcoin network
    - Test version of Bitcoin Core network
    - Test bitcoins with no real value 
3. Regtest (Development)
    - Private local network
    - Fully controlled by the host node 
    - Fake bitcoins 
